{"id":13022,"name":"San Bernardino County","slug":"san-bernardino-county","state":"California","code":"CA","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/california-tax-sale-buy-real-estate-up-to-90-off/san-bernardino-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-06T02:29:14","facts":null,"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"ktsdGevg16OzXMZnpbBjruywS\"><iframe title=\"San Bernardino County | California Tax Deed Sales | Get Homes, Condos &amp; Land at Bargain Prices?\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6LfhxIl8XI8?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Why-Invest-in-San-Bernardino-County-Tax-Deed-Auctions?\">Why Invest in San Bernardino County Tax Deed Auctions?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Investing in San Bernardino County tax deed auctions is recommended for several reasons. First, it is a vast county offering a diverse range of properties. Additionally, the county is experiencing rapid growth, leading to rising property values, which enhances its appeal as a promising investment location. Furthermore, while being close to major cities, San Bernardino maintains a peaceful and attractive environment, making it not only a desirable place to invest but also a pleasant area to live in.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Benefits-of-Tax-Deed-Auctions\">Benefits of Tax Deed Auctions</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Investing in tax deed auctions can be highly profitable. Buyers often purchase properties for significantly less than their market value when owners fail to pay property taxes. This means you can acquire valuable properties at a fraction of the cost.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-to-Get-Started\"><br>How to Start?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>First, visit the San Bernardino County Tax Collector&#8217;s website for detailed information on tax deed sales. Next, review the Tax Sale Information section to understand the terms, conditions, sale schedules, and past sales history. After that, make sure to conduct thorough due diligence by researching each property, including its exact location, boundaries, and any other specifics. Finally, familiarize yourself with the auction process by either attending events in person or placing online offers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Pro Tip: Properties are sold &#8220;as is,&#8221; so it&#8217;s essential to thoroughly research and understand all aspects of the property you&#8217;re interested in before bidding.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/San-Bernardino-County.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/San-Bernardino-County-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/San-Bernardino-County-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/San-Bernardino-County-768x512.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/San-Bernardino-County.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/San-Bernardino-County.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/San-Bernardino-County-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/San-Bernardino-County-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/San-Bernardino-County-768x512.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-13029 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"San Bernardino County, California\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"What-is-a-Tax-Deed-Auction?\">What is a Tax Deed Auction?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-investing-overview/understanding-tax-deed-investing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">tax deed</mark></a> auction is a public sale where properties are sold because of unpaid property taxes. The highest bidder wins the property title.. The highest bidder acquires the property title.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-do-I-find-properties-for-sale?\">How do I find properties for sale in San Bernardino County?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Begin by visiting the County Tax Collector&#8217;s website, then navigate to the Tax Sale Information section. From there, you can access lists of available properties.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"What-happens-if-I-win-a-bid?\">What happens if I win a bid?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you win a bid, you must first pay the amount due, and then you will receive a tax deed to the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Are-there-any-risks?\">Are there any risks?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Yes, properties are sold &#8220;as is,&#8221; and, furthermore, there may be additional costs or legal issues. Therefore, always conduct thorough research before bidding.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Can-I-redeem-a-property-after-purchase?\">Can I redeem a property after purchase?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In some cases, the previous owner may have a redemption period where they can repay the back taxes to reclaim the property. Always check the specific rules for each auction.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"San-Bernardino-County-Links\">San Bernardino County Links</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Resource</th><th class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Link</th></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">San Bernardino County Tax Deed Information</td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://sbcounty.mytaxsale.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">SBcounty.MyTaxSale &#8211; Home</mark></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">San Bernardino County Treasurer and Tax Collector</td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.mytaxcollector.com/ATCBio.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County of San Bernardino</mark></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">County of San Bernardino</td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://main.sbcounty.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Welcome to San Bernardino County</mark></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Bid4Assets Auction Platform</td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://shorturl.at/bhRU2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Bid4Assets</mark></a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"San-Bernardino-County-Links\">Need Help?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Start by getting our free Tax Lien &amp; Deed Mini-Course, or book a call now for a customized investing plan <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">HERE</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; heigh